# Desk Dashboard

- FastAPI `web/app.py`: Upbit from `STATE_PATH`/`LOG_DIR`; Bitget from `BITGET_STATE_PATH` + `BITGET_LOG_DIR` (defaults under `/app/data`, `/app/logs/bitget`).
- `/api/status` returns `status` (Upbit) + `bitget` `{cash,signal,position,recent_trades,latest_text}`.
- UI: ticker shows both exchanges; panels split Upbit/Bitget trades + status text.
- USDT money format: **2 decimal places** (`desk.js` `money()`).
- Auth: cookie + CSRF; no `?token=`. Rate limit uses `X-Real-IP`.
- After desk image recreate on VPS, reload nginx (`upbit-edge`).
